('kf-901', 'KF-ZAR-901', 'Royal Zardozi Floral Brocade', 'sherwani', 'Sherwani Fabrics', 'zari', 'Antique Zari & Dabka Work', 'Pure Matka Silk Organza', 'Sandstone Ivory & Antique Dull Gold', 'ivory', '44 Inches (Full Cuttable)', array['Royal Sherwani','Heritage Achkan','Groom Bandhgala']::text[], '25 Metres (Sample Cuts Available on Request)', true, true, 'An exemplary masterwork from Surat’s premier embroidery artisan ateliers. Woven on a dense unbleached silk organza foundation with imported metallic antique dull gold metallic yarn, accented with delicate micro-sequin illumination.', 'Crafted over 18 machine operating hours per warp meter, with hand-trimmed thread extremities ensuring absolute structural purity and drape integrity.', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1610030469983-98e550d6193c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1594938298603-c8148c4dae35?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1607083206968-13611e3d76db?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1528459801416-a9e53bbf4e17?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583391733956-3750e0ff4e8b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85', array[]::text[], '[{"name":"Sandstone Ivory","hex":"#F4EFE6"},{"name":"Imperial Champagne","hex":"#E7DCB9"},{"name":"Regal Muted Gold","hex":"#AD8A53"}]'::jsonb, 0),
('kf-902', 'KF-CUT-902', 'Imperial Pearl & Cutdana Jaal', 'sherwani', 'Sherwani Fabrics', 'bead', 'Cutdana & Micro-Bead Jaal', 'High-Density Raw Silk Dupion', 'Champagne Beige with Tone-on-Tone Beads', 'sandstone', '46 Inches', array['Wedding Sherwani','Formal Tuxedo Shawl Collar','Cocktail Jacket']::text[], '30 Metres', true, true, 'Intricate geometric trellises interlocking with miniature floral medallions, engineered with imported Japanese glass beads and micro-cutdana for unmatched light refraction under warm event lighting.', 'Digitally programmed precision multi-head embroidery synchronized with delicate tension springs to prevent puckering on high-grade silk foundations.', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584917865442-de89df76afd3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1582738411706-bfc8e691d1c2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1594938298603-c8148c4dae35?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1528459801416-a9e53bbf4e17?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507679799987-c73779587ccf?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85', array[]::text[], '[{"name":"Champagne Beige","hex":"#D7C7B0"},{"name":"Warm Pewter","hex":"#A89F91"},{"name":"Oatmeal Off-White","hex":"#FAF8F3"}]'::jsonb, 1),
('kf-903', 'KF-RES-903', 'Burgundy Resham Kashmiri Paisleys', 'jodhpuri', 'Jodhpuri Fabrics', 'thread', 'Multi-Coloured Resham Silk Threadwork', 'Rich Wool-Touch Velvet Finish', 'Deep Muted Burgundy & Burnt Gold', 'burgundy', '44 Inches', array['Jodhpuri Bandhgala','Regal Nehru Jacket','Bespoke Evening Waistcoat']::text[], '20 Metres', true, true, 'Vibrant yet disciplined silk resham thread embroidery drawing from royal Awadh court silhouettes, executed over micro-pile velvet that holds crisp structured seams without flattening.', 'Each floral bud uses up to six gradated thread shades of raw filament silk to deliver a painterly, three-dimensional depth unattainable in standard commercial runs.', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1617627143750-d86bc21e42bb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584917865442-de89df76afd3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1610030469983-98e550d6193c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1607083206968-13611e3d76db?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507679799987-c73779587ccf?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85', array[]::text[], '[{"name":"Muted Burgundy","hex":"#713B43"},{"name":"Deep Espresso","hex":"#30241F"},{"name":"Royal Prussian Navy","hex":"#1C2938"}]'::jsonb, 2),
('kf-904', 'KF-SEQ-904', 'Midnight Black Sequin Architectural Lattice', 'indo-western', 'Indo-Western Fabrics', 'sequin', 'Monochrome Matte & Gloss Micro-Sequin', 'Structured Suiting Poly-Viscose Blend', 'Jet Black with Smoked Gunmetal Accents', 'black', '48 Inches', array['Asymmetric Indo-Western Coat','Celebrity Red Carpet Jacket','Bespoke Tuxedo']::text[], '35 Metres', false, true, 'A contemporary masculine interpretation of ethnic luxury. Dual-tone micro-sequins laid at deliberate contrasting angles that catch light dynamically only with body movement.', 'Designed in collaboration with Surat master draftsmen to ensure seams align flawlessly across front-panel chest breaks and high-gorge collars.', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558769132-cb1aea458c5e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584917865442-de89df76afd3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1607083206968-13611e3d76db?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1528459801416-a9e53bbf4e17?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507679799987-c73779587ccf?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85', array[]::text[], '[{"name":"Jet Black","hex":"#161616"},{"name":"Charcoal Slag","hex":"#2B2B2B"},{"name":"Midnight Navy","hex":"#181E29"}]'::jsonb, 3),
('kf-905', 'KF-CHK-905', 'Heritage Chikankari Textured Chanderi', 'kurta', 'Kurta Fabrics', 'thread', 'High-Density Tone-on-Tone Threadwork', 'Pure Chanderi Cotton Silk Weave', 'Pure Off-White & Ecru', 'ivory', '45 Inches', array['Luxury Festive Kurta','Haldi & Sangeet Kurta','Layered Angrakha']::text[], '40 Metres', true, false, 'Airy, breathable summer-friendly Chanderi with embossed tone-on-tone embroidery recreating intricate shadow-work (Bakhiya) and trellis jaal.', 'Woven with gentle tensioning so tailoring houses can fuse chest interlinings seamlessly without puckering the sheer breathability of Chanderi.', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1528459801416-a9e53bbf4e17?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1582738411706-bfc8e691d1c2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1594938298603-c8148c4dae35?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1607083206968-13611e3d76db?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583391733956-3750e0ff4e8b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85', array[]::text[], '[{"name":"Ecru Off-White","hex":"#FAF8F3"},{"name":"Pale Buttercream","hex":"#F7F1DE"},{"name":"Ivory Sheen","hex":"#F4EFE6"}]'::jsonb, 4),
('kf-906', 'KF-BRO-906', 'Emerald Green Antique Zari Crest Brocade', 'brocade', 'Premium Brocade', 'zari', 'Woven Jacquard with Heavy Embroidered Motifs', 'Heavyweight Benarasi-Style Tissue Brocade', 'Royal Emerald Green & Burnished Gold', 'emerald', '44 Inches', array['Maharaja Cut Sherwani','Heritage Jodhpuri Suit','Stately Ceremonial Coat']::text[], '25 Metres', true, true, 'A sovereign textile featuring woven paisley buttis further embellished with dense aari and needlework borders along the selvage for effortless border-placement styling.', 'Produced in Surat using custom alloy zari wires that resist oxidation, humidity, and tarnishing even during prolonged store rack display.', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1610030469983-98e550d6193c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1594938298603-c8148c4dae35?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1607083206968-13611e3d76db?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1528459801416-a9e53bbf4e17?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507679799987-c73779587ccf?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85', array[]::text[], '[{"name":"Royal Emerald","hex":"#1E4338"},{"name":"Imperial Maroon","hex":"#582026"},{"name":"Charcoal Slate","hex":"#2E3236"}]'::jsonb, 5),
('kf-907', 'KF-MED-907', 'Royal Navy Resham & Zari Medallions', 'designer', 'Designer Ethnic Fabrics', 'multi', 'Combined Zari, Resham & Micro-Sequins', 'Silk Matka Weave', 'Navy Blue & Rose Gold Accent', 'navy', '46 Inches', array['Modern Bandhgala','Indo-Western Open Sherwani','Celebrity Sangeet Coat']::text[], '30 Metres', true, false, 'Rich circular Mughal architectural cartouches rendered with blended silk resham threads and bordered with dull rose-gold bullion cord embroidery.', 'Engineered specifically for luxury menswear labels desiring distinctive high-concept motif placement across body panels.', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1617627143750-d86bc21e42bb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584917865442-de89df76afd3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1594938298603-c8148c4dae35?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1528459801416-a9e53bbf4e17?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583391733956-3750e0ff4e8b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85', array[]::text[], '[{"name":"Midnight Navy","hex":"#182433"},{"name":"Muted Espresso","hex":"#30241F"},{"name":"Ivory Base","hex":"#FAF8F3"}]'::jsonb, 6),
('kf-908', 'KF-MUK-908', 'Gold Dabka & Mukaish Starlight Fabric', 'sherwani', 'Sherwani Fabrics', 'zari', 'Fine Dabka & Mukaish Needlework Simulation', 'Tussar Georgette Silk', 'Sandstone Beige & Antique Gold', 'gold', '44 Inches', array['Minimalist Royal Sherwani','Formal Stole / Shawl Edge','Classic Bandhgala']::text[], '25 Metres', true, true, 'Scattered constellation of micro-stars and intricate geometric borders engineered to replicate antique Mughal needle-cast mukaish wire work.', 'Ideal for wedding labels looking for subtle regal sheen that photographs impeccably under daylight without glare or distortion.', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584917865442-de89df76afd3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1594938298603-c8148c4dae35?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1607083206968-13611e3d76db?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1528459801416-a9e53bbf4e17?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507679799987-c73779587ccf?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85', array[]::text[], '[{"name":"Sandstone Gold","hex":"#AD8A53"},{"name":"Pale Champagne","hex":"#E2D4BF"},{"name":"Ivory Frost","hex":"#F4EFE6"}]'::jsonb, 7)
